{"ordinal":75,"direction":"s2c","channel":"protocol","epoch":1,"elapsedMs":6644,"wire":{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_18eb2acaba49c21800000317","summary":["The user wants me to use the native question tool exactly once with 1 question. Ask for a short free text project note; accept an Other answer. Report the answers and finish. Do not use other tools.\n\nThe request_user_input tool requires 2-3 mutually exclusive choices, and cannot include \"Other\" because the client adds it. Hmm, but \"accept an Other answer\" — the client adds an Other option automatically. But the question should ask for free text project note. Options are required... The tool schema requires options with 2-3 choices. I can make options like \"No note\" and \"Add a note\" ... but really free text. Perhaps options \"Skip\" and \"Provide note\". The client adds \"Other\" free-form automatically.\n\nLet me call it once."],"content":[],"startedAtMs":1795575926636,"completedAtMs":1795575928471},"threadId":"01a210aa-3d95-7ac3-ae1c-6b64f43cfb26","turnId":"01a210aa-3dac-7521-a04e-fc7fc3ad9aa4","completedAtMs":1795575928471},"emittedAtMs":1795575928471}}
